scenario deliberately-wrong expectations, used only by the rig's self-test
describe Not part of the suite. tests/test_replay_rig.cpp loads this file to
describe check that the runner actually reports a mismatch — a rig that passes
describe everything is indistinguishable from a rig that checks nothing, and
describe that is the failure this whole directory exists to avoid.

at 0
  fix 3d
  pos 5000000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect validity nofix
  expect trust untrusted
  expect reason receiver-spoofing
